{'symbol': 'XEL', 'date': '2022-12-14 15:50:00', 'title': 'XCEL ENERGY INC. BOARD DECLARES DIVIDEND ON COMMON STOCK', 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS--( BUSINESS WIRE )--THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF XCEL ENERGY INC. (NASDAQ: XEL) TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON ITS COMMON STOCK OF 48.75 CENTS PER SHARE. THE DIVIDENDS ARE PAYABLE JANUARY 20, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON DECEMBER 29, 2022.'}